{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ \"racial bullying\" percent students)"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_52_1045081918#14_2068023527","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q2281","rank":1,"snippet":"How do I register with SlidesFinder? > Is it safe to access SlidesFinder using Facebook sign-in credentials? > Is slidesfinder account confirmation is mandatory? > Do I need to signup/login on SlidesFinder before uploading a PowerPoint presentation? © 2013 SlidesFinder. All rights reserved. \" , \"segment\": \"Bullying by girls declines at age 14. Slide 19 - Bullying Behavior Researchers believe bullying rates are unrelated to school or class size, inner city or suburb. Socially disadvantaged areas seem to have higher rates. Classes with students with behavioral, emotional or learning problems, have more bullies and victims. Slide 20 - Bullying Behavior <cover>Racial bullying: 25 percent of students </cover>victimized, reported they were belittled about their race or religion. Black youth reported being bullied less than Hispanic and White peers. Slide 21 - Bullying Behavior Unknown: Whether certain types of bullying are more harmful than others. If certain types of bullying have longer-term impact on victims.\" , \"start_char\": 7949.000000 , \"title\": \"Free Download Bullying in Schools PowerPoint Presentation Slides\" , \"url\": \"https://www.slidesfinder.com/presentation/bullying-in-schools-ppt-slides/2091.aspx\" }"}}
