{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_48_94142915#2_185120132","relevance":3,"reason":"This is another segment of the NBC News article dedicated to racist bullying among Asian American youth; the title/URL directly state that 1 in 4, or 25%, of Asian American youths experience racist bullying, and the snippet discusses the underlying youth research context.","learned":"NBC/Stop AAPI Hate evidence repeated: about one-quarter (25%, 1 in 4) of Asian American youths experienced racist bullying amid anti-Asian racism."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q2298","reason":"The racist-bullying query is yielding grade-3 evidence; continue to find further documents or distinct sources with exact percentages."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q2298"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_48_94142915#4_185124964","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q2298","rank":4,"snippet":"who were present in nearly half of the cases and almost never intervened. Recommended Lifestyle Lifestyle How to define an AAPI-owned business Asian America Asian America Muslim Americans on finding love as third-culture-kids-turned-adults Even before the pandemic began, Asian American students reported high rates of bullying. In California public high schools, for instance, AAPI <cover>students are the racial group most likely to be bullied, according to data from the California Healthy Kids Survey. \"Asian Americans are targeted for their racial differences and linguistic or immigration status differences,\" said Russell Jeung, a professor of Asian American Studies at San Francisco State University, who oversaw the youth project. \" Part of this is because teachers don't always recognize when Asian Americans are being bullied and stigmatized. They may not acknowledge that certain gestures, like pulling your eyes slanted, can be offensive.\"\" , \"start_char\": 3049.000000 , \"title\": \"'You have Chinese virus!': 1 in 4 Asian American youths experience racist bullying, report says\" , \"url\": \"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/asian-america/25-percent-</cover>asian-american-youths-racist-bullying-n1240380\" }"}}
