{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_48_94142915#4_185124964","relevance":3,"reason":"This is another segment of the NBC News article dedicated to racist bullying among Asian American youth; the title/URL state that 1 in 4, or 25%, of Asian American youths experience racist bullying, and the snippet adds context that AAPI students are highly likely to be bullied.","learned":"NBC/Stop AAPI Hate evidence repeated: 25% (1 in 4) of Asian American youths experience racist bullying; California Healthy Kids Survey context says AAPI students are especially likely to be bullied."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q2298","reason":"The racist-bullying query is still producing grade-3 evidence, so continue for more exact percentage sources or additional relevant segments."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q2298"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_48_94142915#6_185129923","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q2298","rank":5,"snippet":"says, all <cover>students can develop a deeper understanding of the roots and ramifications of racist policies and attitudes. Amanda Young, a senior at Campolindo High School in the Bay Area city of Moraga, said the Asian American history covered by California's public schools is rudimentary, even though the state has the largest Asian population in the country. \"For the most part, the Chinese Exclusion Act and the Japanese internment camps were the extent of our lessons,\" she said. Several student researchers said they were surprised to discover just how normalized anti-Asian stereotypes have become. Beth Yeung, a sophomore at Aragon High School in the Bay Area city of San Mateo, said interviewing friends and family for the project was an emotional experience. \"This is not something that my family has talked about a lot,\" she said, adding that she's been brushing off microaggressions since she was young.\" , \"start_char\": 4527.000000 , \"title\": \"'You have Chinese virus!': 1 in 4 Asian American youths experience racist bullying, report says\" , \"url\": \"https://www.nbcnews.com/news/asian-america/25-percent-</cover>asian-american-"}}
